-- Notification records for seed orders.
-- CONFIRMED orders → PAYMENT_SUCCESS + STOCK_RESERVED (2 notifications each).
-- PAYMENT_FAILED orders → PAYMENT_FAILED (1 notification).
-- STOCK_INSUFFICIENT orders → STOCK_INSUFFICIENT (1 notification).
-- CANCELLED orders → no notifications (cancelled before processing).
-- order_id values match order-service V2 seed data exactly.
-- Notification IDs use a ntf- prefix; payment notifications use ntf-p-*, stock use ntf-s-*.

